---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout lang="en" title="Electric vehicle charging on tour" activeNav="/gezelschappen" bodyClass="page-gezelschappen">
<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Charging on tour</h1>
      <div class="hero-split">
        <div class="hero-text">
          <p class="hero-lead">A production may be ready to go electric even when grid congestion makes it hard to install chargers at its own depot. Theatres often have spare capacity during the day, and the trucks are already parked there for the show. Stroomlijnen is building a nationwide network of chargers at Dutch theatres. <strong>One card, one rate and one invoice</strong> across the network. Plug in during the get-in, the performance or the get-out. You pay the cultural-sector rate directly through Stroomlijnen, without roaming or a third-party charging card.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="hero-figure">
          <img src="/images/dock-dusk-1100.jpg" srcset="/images/dock-dusk-600.jpg 600w, /images/dock-dusk-1100.jpg 1100w" sizes="(max-width:900px) 100vw, 46vw" alt="Electric truck plugged in at a loading dock at dusk" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1100" height="620">
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="claim-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <p>One card, one rate and one invoice wherever your tour stops on the network.</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <p class="what-kicker">Getting started</p>
      <div class="what-box">
        <h2 class="what-h2">One account for the whole network</h2>
        <div class="account-split">
          <div class="account-copy">
            <p class="body">Apply for a Stroomlijnen account to use our chargers.</p>
            <p class="body">Your portal shows all your vehicles and charging sessions in one place.</p>
            <p class="body">We’ll send you a master charging card to register your vehicles.</p>
            <p class="body">Once a vehicle is registered, plug it in and charging starts automatically.</p>
            <p class="body">You pay for your charging sessions at the cultural-sector rate, with no subscription fee.</p>
            <p class="body">We invoice monthly in arrears.</p>
            <p class="body">Register a hire vehicle for the length of the hire. Its access expires automatically.</p>
          </div>
          <figure class="account-figure">
            <img src="/images/lader-ps-bus.jpg" alt="Pieter Smit van at a charger at Lichtwerk" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="675">
          </figure>
        </div>
        <div class="shots-grid">
          <figure class="shot">
            <img src="/images/inlogscherm-lader-360.png" alt="Sign-in screen on the charger" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="360" height="575">
            <figcaption>Sign in at the charger</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="shot">
            <img src="/images/identificeren-pc-360.png" alt="Identification screen for Plug &amp; Charge" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="360" height="575">
            <figcaption>Identify yourself for Plug &amp; Charge</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="shot">
            <img src="/images/voertuig-toevoegen-pc-360.png" alt="Adding a vehicle for Plug &amp; Charge" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="360" height="575">
            <figcaption>Add a vehicle for Plug &amp; Charge</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a href="https://stroomlijnen.nl/en/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Request an account →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>



  <section class="trio">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="what-kicker">Mobile charger</p>
      <div class="what-box">
        <h2 class="what-h2">No charger at the theatre yet?</h2>
        <div class="trio-grid">
          <div class="trio-panel">
            <h3>Charger specifications</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>30 kW CCS charger</li>
              <li>63 A CEE connection, 50 A continuous</li>
              <li>Plug and play</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <figure class="trio-figure">
            <img src="/images/mobiele-lader-30kw.jpg" alt="Mobile 30 kW charger" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="500" height="500">
          </figure>
          <div class="trio-panel">
            <h3>Purchase price</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>€8,999 excluding VAT</li>
              <li>This mobile charger is ineligible for the SPRILA grant.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section>
    <div class="container cta-block">
      <h2>Need an account or have a question?</h2>
      <p>Get in touch and we’ll arrange your account and cultural-sector rate.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="https://stroomlijnen.nl/en/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Request an account →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
